repository-code: "https://github.com/umr240/investment-intelligence"
abstract: >-
  A command-line equity research tool that scores companies against seven
  frameworks drawn from published finance research, computing from SEC EDGAR
  filings deterministically and recording missing data explicitly rather than
  estimating it.
keywords:
  - quantitative-finance
  - equity-research
  - sec-edgar
  - financial-analysis
